amwork issues.\n\nProbably B is best overall, but need to consider that pretentiousness and tone could be serious for crew. However stress handling is vital. Also B's technical competence (weather, computer) is good.\n\nThus provisional preference: Candidate B.\n\nUncertainty: communication/teamwork concerns could be mitigated with training; lack of info on B's teamwork beyond tone. Need more info on B's teamwork and crew cooperation. Also need to know if B's pretentiousness affects safety.\n\nWhat would change vote: If another agent has strong positive teamwork evidence for A, C, or D, or negative stress handling for B, could shift.\n\nNow produce public message."}
