think Candidate C might be the best overall, provided communication issues can be addressed. However we have no evidence that those issues are severe. The group may need more info. I will state provisional preference for Candidate C, with uncertainty about communication.\n\nNow produce public message: include key evidence (our own data), evidence from others (Agent3's preference for B, Agent2's info on B teamwork, Agent1's info on C teamwork, Agent2's info on D stress/teamwork). Summarize alternatives, tradeoffs, remaining uncertainty, what would change vote.\n\nLet's craft."}
